      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUN BINDI RUN (1) turned in a solid run last start over 330m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 1.5 lengths (19.05). Has ability and looks hard to stop. JACOBITE BATTLE (6) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing fourth (25.50) in a Grade 5 at Goulburn. Can find the frame this time. HEY MARTY (2) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (26.03). Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. WHAT EVER (3) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
